      "id": "IntendedExperience",
      "name": "IntendedExperience",
      "summary": "Sets your settings per map so GLS maps, Chroma maps and modcharts look the way the mapper made them.",
      "description": "# IntendedExperience\n\nSets your settings per map so GLS maps, Chroma maps and modcharts look the way the mapper made them, then puts them back.\n\n- Turns on effects, the map's colors and environment, and full BeatSaberPlus brightness\n- Shows the changes in the song browser tab and on the Play button\n- The IE button next to Play excludes a map\n- Works with Heck's Settings Setter and BeatSaberPlus Multiplayer+\n\nMore in the [README](https://github.com/Fatalution/BS_IntendedExperience#readme).\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- BSIPA 4.3.0+\n- BSML 1.14.1+ (1.12.5+ on 1.40.8, 1.6.10+ on 1.29.1)\n- SiraUtil 3.3.1+ (3.2.1+ on 1.40.8, 3.1.2+ on 1.29.1)\n- SongCore 3.16.0+ (3.15.3+ on 1.40.8, 3.11.1+ on 1.29.1)\n- Optional: Heck, Chroma, BeatSaberPlus",
      "iconUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fatalution/BS_Mods/main/icons/IntendedExperience.webp",
      "category": "lighting",
      "author": "Fatalution",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/Fatalution/BS_IntendedExperience",
